    "description": "<p>The standard Fragmentation Grenade unleashes metal shrapnel with explosive force, slicing up anyone within the 2-Square <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burst\">Burst</a> radius. It is designed to explode on contact after it is thrown, dealing damage in the same turn it is hurled. </p><p>When you make an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area Attack\">Area Attack</a> with a Frag Grenade, you make a single attack roll and compare the result to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> of every target in the Grenade's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burst\">Burst</a> radius. Creatures you hit take full damage, and creatures you miss take half damage. </p><p>A target with the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Evasion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Evasion\">Evasion</a></b> Talent takes half damage from a successful attack, and no damage if the attack misses. </p><p><b>Special:</b>&nbsp;This is an&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area Attack\">Area Attack</a>&nbsp;Weapon. </p>",
